<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>삼보모터스 로봇팔 자동 분류 시스템</title>
<script src="./three.min.js"></script>
<style>
/* ===== Design tokens ===== */
:root{
  --bg:#07101b;--bg2:#0a1524;--card:#0d1b2d;--card2:#102238;--line:#1c3855;
  --text:#d9e9f5;--muted:#83a0b6;--dim:#4e6b82;--cyan:#20d5e8;--green:#4ade80;
  --yellow:#f7c948;--red:#ff5b5b;--purple:#a78bfa;--blue:#60a5fa;
  --shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.25);--radius:10px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0;width:100%;min-height:100%;overflow-x:hidden}
html{overflow-y:auto}
body{overflow-y:visible}
body{
  color:var(--text);background:var(--bg);font-family:"Pretendard","Noto Sans KR","Malgun Gothic","Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  letter-spacing:-.1px;
}
body::before{
  content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.4;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 25% -10%,rgba(32,213,232,.12),transparent 33%),
             radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%,rgba(96,165,250,.08),transparent 28%);
}
button,select{font:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
.mono{font-family:"Cascadia Mono","Consolas",monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.muted{color:var(--muted)}.dim{color:var(--dim)}.green{color:var(--green)}.cyan{color:var(--cyan)}
.yellow{color:var(--yellow)}.red{color:var(--red)}.blue{color:var(--blue)}


/* ===== Sambo Motors style lock/start screen ===== */
.splash-screen{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9999;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;
  background:#21458f;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1f4593 0%,#214895 45%,#183879 100%);
  transition:opacity .55s ease,transform .65s ease,filter .65s ease;
}
.splash-screen.hidden{opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transform:scale(1.025);filter:blur(10px)}
.splash-screen::before{
  content:"";position:absolute;inset:-18%;opacity:.55;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 17% 62%,rgba(107,189,230,.35),transparent 22%),
             radial-gradient(circle at 78% 24%,rgba(255,255,255,.08),transparent 26%),
             linear-gradient(120deg,transparent 0 43%,rgba(255,255,255,.06) 43% 44%,transparent 44% 100%);
}
.splash-grid{
  position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.16;mix-blend-mode:screen;
  background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.12) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.12) 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:64px 64px;transform:skewX(-12deg) scale(1.2);
}
.splash-nav{height:86px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 34px;gap:34px;position:relative;z-index:3}
.splash-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;min-width:340px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.5px;font-size:31px;line-height:1}
.splash-logo-mark{position:relative;width:54px;height:30px;display:inline-block}
.splash-logo-mark i{position:absolute;top:0;height:30px;background:#fff;transform:skewX(-28deg);border-radius:2px}
.splash-logo-mark i:nth-child(1){left:0;width:12px}.splash-logo-mark i:nth-child(2){left:17px;width:12px}.splash-logo-mark i:nth-child(3){left:34px;width:20px}
.splash-menu{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:48px;flex:1;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;white-space:nowrap}
.splash-menu span{opacity:.96}.splash-menu span:nth-child(3){letter-spacing:1px}
.splash-login{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap}
.splash-pill{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.52);border-radius:28px;padding:13px 19px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);font-weight:800}
.splash-pill.white{background:#fff;color:#1f4593;border-color:#fff}
.splash-hero{position:relative;z-index:2;height:calc(100vh - 86px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(690px,1.1fr) minmax(520px,.9fr);align-items:center;padding:22px 76px 78px 0}
.splash-motif{position:relative;height:610px;min-width:690px;margin-left:-34px;filter:drop-shadow(0 34px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.26))}
.sambo-letter{position:absolute;inset:40px 0 0 0}
.sambo-panel{position:absolute;height:72%;top:80px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#88d0e8,#2b6faa 48%,#153771);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
.sambo-panel::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.55),rgba(255,255,255,.05) 32%,rgba(4,15,37,.18)),radial-gradient(circle at 35% 75%,rgba(255,255,255,.42),transparent 20%)}
.sambo-panel.left{left:0;width:360px;clip-path:polygon(23% 0,100% 0,82% 100%,0 100%)}
.sambo-panel.mid{left:314px;width:330px;clip-path:polygon(0 0,70% 0,100% 100%,30% 100%)}
.sambo-panel.right{left:590px;width:352px;clip-path:polygon(0 0,82% 0,100% 100%,18% 100%)}
.splash-road{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:70px;height:164px;background:linear-gradient(175deg,rgba(6,12,24,.96),rgba(7,24,45,.82));clip-path:polygon(0 30%,74% 0,100% 37%,100% 100%,0 100%)}
.splash-road::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:70px;right:170px;top:74px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#dff6ff,transparent);box-shadow:0 22px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.42)}
.robot-showcase{position:absolute;left:120px;bottom:86px;width:455px;height:245px;border-radius:34px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.94),rgba(140,205,235,.76) 45%,rgba(34,84,142,.82));clip-path:polygon(8% 46%,23% 23%,64% 12%,86% 30%,96% 61%,88% 76%,30% 86%,7% 70%);box-shadow:0 24px 42px rgba(0,0,0,.28)}
.robot-showcase::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:103px;top:67px;width:210px;height:84px;border:15px solid rgba(15,49,93,.7);border-bottom:0;border-radius:120px 120px 0 0;transform:skewX(-8deg)}
.robot-showcase::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:70px;right:64px;bottom:34px;height:8px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#20d5e8,#fff,#4ade80,#f7c948)}
.robot-arm-silhouette{position:absolute;left:490px;top:235px;width:210px;height:190px;opacity:.74}
.robot-arm-silhouette svg{width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible}.robot-arm-silhouette path,.robot-arm-silhouette circle{filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.32))}
.splash-copy{position:relative;z-index:5;padding-left:30px;margin-top:30px}
.splash-kicker{font-weight:900;color:#b8dfff;letter-spacing:4px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:24px}
.splash-copy h2{font-size:76px;line-height:1;margin:0 0 28px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.5px;text-shadow:0 18px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
.splash-copy h3{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 22px;font-weight:900}.splash-copy p{color:#c7dcff;font-size:17px;line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 28px;max-width:760px;font-weight:600}
.splash-meta{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px}.splash-meta span{padding:8px 11px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);border-radius:7px;background:rgba(5,16,38,.24);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#dcecff}
.access-card{width:min(620px,100%);padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.26);border-radius:16px;background:rgba(6,21,52,.36);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);box-shadow:0 24px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.18);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:14px;align-items:center}
.access-title{font-size:12px;color:#a9caff;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3px}.access-main{font-size:22px;font-weight:900;margin-top:5px}.access-sub{font-size:12px;color:#bfdbff;margin-top:7px;line-height:1.55}
.access-btn{height:56px;padding:0 28px;border:0;border-radius:13px;background:#fff;color:#214895;font-size:16px;font-weight:900;box-shadow:0 14px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.22);transition:.16s}
.access-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 18px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.28)}
.splash-side{position:absolute;z-index:4;right:0;top:54%;transform:translateY(-50%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 18px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.22)}
.splash-side button{width:98px;height:92px;border:0;color:#fff;background:#53a8e5;font-weight:900;font-size:17px;line-height:1.35}.splash-side button:nth-child(2){background:#037abd}.splash-side button:nth-child(3){background:#0a244f}.splash-side button:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
.splash-footer{position:absolute;left:35px;right:35px;bottom:24px;z-index:4;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:rgba(255,255,255,.62);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px}
.splash-scan{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.85),transparent);animation:splashScan 3.4s linear infinite;opacity:.55}
@keyframes splashScan{0%{transform:translateY(-6px)}100%{transform:translateY(100vh)}}
@media(max-width:1450px){.splash-menu{gap:24px}.splash-copy h2{font-size:58px}.splash-hero{grid-template-columns:minmax(570px,1fr) minmax(430px,.8fr);padding-right:48px}.splash-motif{transform:scale(.86);transform-origin:left center;margin-left:-55px}.splash-logo{min-width:290px;font-size:26px}.splash-nav{gap:18px}}


/* ===== User revision: simplified Sambo lock header ===== */
.splash-nav{height:92px;padding:0 42px;justify-content:flex-start;gap:0}
.splash-logo{min-width:auto;gap:0}
.splash-logo-img{width:154px;height:auto;display:block;background:transparent;border-radius:0;padding:0;filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.24))}
.splash-menu,.splash-login,.splash-side{display:none!important}
.splash-copy{padding-left:18px}
.brand.brand-with-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:345px;min-width:345px}
.brand-logo-img{width:80px;height:auto;display:block;background:transparent;border-radius:0;padding:0;filter:drop-shadow(0 5px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.22))}
.brand-caption{color:var(--dim);font-size:10px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:.75px;font-weight:800}
@media(max-width:1450px){.splash-logo-img{width:142px}.brand.brand-with-logo{width:300px;min-width:300px}.brand-logo-img{width:72px}.brand-caption{font-size:9px}}

/* ===== Project-specific intro screen ===== */
.splash-screen{background:radial-gradient(circle at 73% 42%,rgba(13,117,185,.24),transparent 34%),linear-gradient(135deg,#061121 0%,#0a1c35 50%,#071525 100%);overflow:hidden}
.splash-screen::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(68,210,255,.04) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(rgba(68,210,255,.04) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:58px 58px;mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(0,0,0,.82),transparent 92%)}
.intro-shell{position:relative;z-index:3;display:grid;height:100%;padding:0 54px;grid-template-rows:96px 1fr 54px}
.intro-header,.intro-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.intro-header{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(135,215,255,.22)}
.intro-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}
.intro-logo-box{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0;background:transparent;border-radius:0}
.intro-logo{display:block;width:145px;height:auto;filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.24))}
.intro-brand-copy b,.intro-diagram-head b,.intro-open-label,.intro-kicker{letter-spacing:1.35px}
.intro-brand-copy b{display:block;color:#e5f6ff;font-size:15px}
.intro-brand-copy span{display:block;margin-top:6px;color:#7f9cb6;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.2px}
.intro-header-state{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;color:#9bb7cc;font:800 12px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:1px}
.intro-live-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#2ee6aa;box-shadow:0 0 16px #2ee6aa}
.intro-main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(590px,.92fr) minmax(650px,1.08fr);gap:46px;align-items:center;min-height:0}
.intro-copy{max-width:760px}
.intro-kicker{color:#56d8ff;font:900 12px/1.2 var(--mono)}
.intro-title{margin:20px 0 18px;color:#f3fbff;font-size:58px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-2.8px}
.intro-title strong{display:block;color:#6fddff}
.intro-desc{max-width:700px;margin:0;color:#b7ccdc;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.8;word-break:keep-all}
.intro-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin:27px 0 28px}
.intro-chip{padding:9px 11px;border:1px solid rgba(91,204,255,.25);border-radius:4px;background:rgba(10,44,73,.66);color:#b9def0;font:800 11px/1 var(--mono)}
.intro-open-card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;max-width:700px;padding:17px 18px;border:1px solid rgba(72,207,255,.32);border-left:4px solid #38cfff;border-radius:7px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(12,47,76,.92),rgba(8,32,57,.78));box-shadow:0 16px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.22)}
.intro-open-copy{flex:1}
.intro-open-label{color:#46dcff;font:900 11px/1 var(--mono)}
.intro-open-copy b{display:block;margin-top:7px;color:#f0fbff;font-size:20px}
.intro-open-copy p{margin:6px 0 0;color:#9db5c9;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.55;word-break:keep-all}
.intro-open-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-width:180px;justify-content:center;padding:15px 17px;border:1px solid #72e4ff;border-radius:4px;background:#35bce7;color:#052139;font-size:15px;font-weight:950;cursor:pointer;transition:.18s}
.intro-open-btn:hover{background:#72e4ff;transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(53,188,231,.25)}
.intro-open-btn span{font:900 22px/1 var(--mono)}
.intro-key{margin-top:10px;color:#7593a9;font:700 11px/1.4 var(--mono)}
.intro-diagram{position:relative;height:640px;border:1px solid rgba(108,204,255,.22);border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(12,38,67,.82),rgba(5,20,38,.90));box-shadow:0 24px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.24);overflow:hidden}
.intro-diagram::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 51% 51%,rgba(42,180,229,.18),transparent 34%),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(101,204,255,.045) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(rgba(101,204,255,.045) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:auto,32px 32px,32px 32px}
.intro-diagram-head{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:22px;right:22px;top:19px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#86a9c3;font:800 10px/1 var(--mono)}
.intro-diagram-head b{color:#56d8ff}
.intro-links{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}
.intro-links path{fill:none;stroke:#2aaed8;stroke-width:2.5;stroke-dasharray:7 7;opacity:.72}
.flow-card{position:absolute;z-index:3;width:184px;padding:13px 14px;border:1px solid rgba(92,210,255,.45);border-radius:6px;background:rgba(7,31,54,.92);box-shadow:0 12px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
.flow-card b{display:block;color:#e6f8ff;font:900 13px/1.2 var(--mono)}
.flow-card span{display:block;margin-top:7px;color:#85a9bf;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.35}
.flow-card em{display:block;margin-top:7px;color:#49dcff;font:800 10px/1 var(--mono);font-style:normal}
.flow-pi{left:30px;top:110px}.flow-can{right:28px;top:110px}.flow-nano{left:30px;bottom:78px}.flow-servo{right:28px;bottom:78px}
.intro-robot-card{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:50%;top:51%;width:340px;height:390px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}
.intro-robot{width:100%;height:100%;filter:drop-shadow(0 18px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.26))}
.robot-metal{fill:#e7eef2;stroke:#75dfff;stroke-width:2}.robot-dark{fill:#18334e;stroke:#5ecce8;stroke-width:2}.robot-joint{fill:#0a5684;stroke:#c5f3ff;stroke-width:5}.robot-arm-line{fill:none;stroke:#e5f4f8;stroke-width:29;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.robot-arm-accent{fill:none;stroke:#4ecff2;stroke-width:4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.intro-robot-tag{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:9px;transform:translateX(-50%);min-width:240px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid rgba(97,216,255,.33);border-radius:4px;background:rgba(6,28,49,.86);text-align:center}
.intro-robot-tag b{display:block;color:#e7f9ff;font:900 12px/1 var(--mono)}
.intro-robot-tag span{display:block;margin-top:7px;color:#5cd7fb;font:800 10px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.8px}
.intro-footer{border-top:1px solid rgba(135,215,255,.18);color:#7795aa;font:800 10px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.65px}
.intro-footer strong{color:#9fcce0}
@media(max-width:1500px){.intro-shell{padding:0 38px}.intro-main{grid-template-columns:minmax(540px,.92fr) minmax(570px,1.08fr);gap:28px}.intro-title{font-size:48px}.intro-desc{font-size:17px}.intro-diagram{height:560px}.intro-robot-card{width:295px;height:348px}.flow-card{width:160px;padding:11px}.flow-card b{font-size:11px}.flow-card span{font-size:10px}.flow-pi,.flow-nano{left:20px}.flow-can,.flow-servo{right:20px}}
@media(max-width:1180px){.intro-main{grid-template-columns:1fr}.intro-diagram{display:none}.intro-copy{max-width:820px}.intro-title{font-size:52px}}

/* ===== Header ===== */
.header{
  height:68px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;padding:0 16px;
  background:rgba(9,20,35,.97);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;
}
.brand{width:315px;min-width:315px}
.brand h1{margin:0;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.5px}.brand h1 span{color:var(--cyan)}
.brand p{margin:5px 0 0;color:var(--dim);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.8px}
.header-status{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;min-width:0}
.status-chip{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;height:34px;padding:0 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:7px;background:rgba(13,27,45,.82);font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;
}
.status-chip b{font-size:11px}.status-chip .tiny{font-size:9px;color:var(--dim);display:block;margin-top:1px}
.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--dim);box-shadow:0 0 8px currentColor}
.dot.ok{background:var(--green);color:var(--green)}.dot.run{background:var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan)}
.dot.warn{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--yellow)}.dot.err{background:var(--red);color:var(--red)}
.mode-chip{min-width:108px;justify-content:center;color:var(--cyan);border-color:rgba(32,213,232,.5);font-weight:800}
.demo-banner{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;color:var(--yellow);border-color:rgba(247,201,72,.42);
  background:rgba(247,201,72,.08);font-weight:800
}
.header-time{text-align:right;font-size:14px;line-height:1.15;color:var(--text);min-width:75px}
.header-time small{display:block;font-size:9px;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:3px}
.estop{
  height:48px;min-width:142px;border:2px solid #ff7777;border-radius:9px;color:#fff;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ce2b35,#8b1723);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1px;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(255,91,91,.12),inset 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.22);
}
.estop:hover{filter:brightness(1.16)}.estop small{display:block;font-size:9px;opacity:.72;margin-top:2px}

/* ===== Navigation ===== */
.toolbar{
  height:47px;padding:6px 15px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.7);
  background:rgba(7,16,27,.92);position:sticky;top:68px;z-index:8;
}
.nav-tabs{display:flex;gap:5px}
.tab,.tool-btn,.small-btn{
  color:var(--muted);background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;
  transition:.15s;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;
}
.tab:hover,.tool-btn:hover,.small-btn:hover{color:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan)}
.tab.active{color:#04161b;background:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan)}
.toolbar-spacer{flex:1}
.tool-btn{padding:7px 10px;font-size:11px;background:rgba(13,27,45,.75)}
.safety-note{font-size:10px;color:var(--yellow);margin-right:8px;white-space:nowrap}

/* ===== Main layout ===== */
.layout{min-height:1120px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:82px minmax(0,1fr) 410px;gap:7px;padding:7px;align-items:start}
.workspace{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;min-width:0;display:grid;grid-template-rows:560px 330px;gap:7px;align-self:start}
.right-panel{grid-column:3;grid-row:1 / span 2;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;align-self:start;position:fixed;right:7px;top:122px;width:410px;height:calc(100vh - 129px);overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:hidden;padding-bottom:10px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#285075 #07121e;z-index:6}
.right-panel .panel{flex:0 0 auto;overflow:visible}
.right-panel .compact-body{flex:0 0 auto;min-height:0}
.right-panel .compact-line{align-items:flex-start}
.right-panel .compact-line span{min-width:0}
.right-panel .compact-line b{text-align:right;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.panel{
  position:relative;min-width:0;min-height:0;overflow:hidden;background:rgba(13,27,45,.94);
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.panel-head{
  height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 11px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.72);
  color:var(--text);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1px;background:rgba(16,34,56,.75);
}
.panel-head::before{content:"";width:4px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--cyan)}
.panel-head small{color:var(--dim);font-size:10px;font-weight:600}
.head-right{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.source-tag{padding:3px 6px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;color:var(--dim);font-size:9px}
.source-tag.demo{color:var(--yellow);border-color:rgba(247,201,72,.42);background:rgba(247,201,72,.08)}
.source-tag.live{color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(74,222,128,.42);background:rgba(74,222,128,.08)}

/* ===== Center stage ===== */
.main-stage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:7px;min-height:0}
.main-stage.split-stage{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr)}
.main-stage>.panel{height:100%}
.main-stage.manual-stage{grid-template-columns:minmax(390px,.72fr) minmax(0,1.28fr)}
.main-stage.manual-stage>.panel{display:flex!important;flex-direction:column}
.view-rail{grid-column:1;grid-row:1 / span 2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;min-height:0;height:calc(100vh - 129px);position:fixed;left:7px;top:122px;width:82px}
.rail-title{padding:9px 5px;text-align:center;color:var(--dim);font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px}
.view-btn{
  min-height:76px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;
  color:var(--muted);background:rgba(13,27,45,.94);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;
  font-size:10px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;transition:.15s
}
.view-btn:hover{color:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan)}
.view-btn.active{color:#04161b;background:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(32,213,232,.22)}
.view-btn .view-icon{font-size:21px;line-height:1}
.rail-spacer{flex:1}
.rail-note{padding:7px 3px;color:var(--dim);font-size:8px;text-align:center;line-height:1.5}
.media-panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.media-wrap{position:relative;flex:1;min-height:0;background:#050c14;overflow:hidden}
.media-wrap canvas,.media-wrap video{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}
.media-wrap video{object-fit:cover;display:none}
.canvas-overlay{pointer-events:none}
.hud{
  position:absolute;padding:5px 7px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(5,12,20,.72);
  border:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.7);font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);backdrop-filter:blur(4px)
}
.hud b{font-size:12px}.hud-left{left:10px;bottom:10px}.hud-right{right:10px;top:10px;text-align:right}
.hud{line-height:1.52}
.hud-bottom{right:10px;bottom:10px;text-align:right}
.crosshair{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:54px;height:54px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);pointer-events:none}
.crosshair::before,.crosshair::after{content:"";position:absolute;background:rgba(74,222,128,.78)}
.crosshair::before{left:0;right:0;top:26px;height:1px}.crosshair::after{top:0;bottom:0;left:26px;width:1px}
.crosshair i{position:absolute;left:17px;top:17px;width:20px;height:20px;border:1px solid var(--green);border-radius:50%}
.pose-info{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--line)
}
.pose-info div{padding:7px 9px;background:var(--card);font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}
.pose-info b{display:block;color:var(--text);font-size:12px;margin-top:2px}
.pose-disclaimer{position:absolute;left:10px;right:10px;bottom:9px;font-size:10px;color:#b5d4e8;background:rgba(5,12,20,.78);padding:5px 7px;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.7)}

/* ===== 3D view ===== */
.sim3d-tools{display:flex;gap:4px}
.sim3d-tools button{
  padding:3px 6px;color:var(--muted);background:#0a1727;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;font-size:9px
}
.sim3d-tools button:hover{color:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan)}
.sim-labels{position:absolute;left:10px;bottom:10px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;max-width:72%}
.sim-labels span{font-size:9px;padding:3px 5px;border:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.78);border-radius:4px;color:var(--dim);background:rgba(5,12,20,.68)}
.sim-labels span.now{color:var(--cyan);border-color:rgba(32,213,232,.55)}

/* ===== Lower stage ===== */
.lower-stage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(365px,.8fr);gap:7px}
.topdown-wrap{position:relative;height:calc(100% - 34px);background:#07121e}
.topdown-wrap canvas{width:100%;height:100%}
.path-content{padding:10px 11px;height:calc(100% - 34px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}
.path-track{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0;overflow:hidden;padding-top:2px}
.path-node{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;min-width:48px}
.path-dot{width:25px;height:25px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:2px solid var(--dim);border-radius:50%;font-size:9px;color:var(--dim);background:#091522}
.path-node.done .path-dot{color:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);background:rgba(74,222,128,.09)}
.path-node.current .path-dot{color:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan);background:rgba(32,213,232,.11);animation:pulse 1.4s infinite}
.path-node.adjust .path-dot{color:var(--yellow);border-color:var(--yellow)}
.path-name{font-size:8px;color:var(--dim)}.path-node.current .path-name{color:var(--cyan)}
.path-line{height:2px;min-width:11px;flex:1;background:var(--line);margin-top:-13px}
.path-line.done{background:var(--green)}
.progress{height:8px;border-radius:6px;background:#07121e;overflow:hidden}
.progress i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0f8f9e,var(--cyan));transition:.4s}
.route-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:5px}
.mini-stat{padding:7px;background:#091522;border:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.65);border-radius:6px;font-size:9px;color:var(--dim)}
.mini-stat b{display:block;color:var(--text);font-size:12px;margin-top:3px}
.wp-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}
.wp-actions button{padding:6px 8px;font-size:10px}
.wp-list{display:flex;gap:5px;overflow:hidden;min-height:26px}
.wp-chip{padding:4px 6px;border:1px solid rgba(32,213,232,.34);color:var(--cyan);border-radius:4px;font-size:9px;background:rgba(32,213,232,.05)}

/* ===== Wide operations deck ===== */
.operations-deck{grid-column:2;grid-row:2;min-width:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.08fr) minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,.96fr);grid-template-rows:42px 252px 258px;gap:7px;scroll-margin-top:122px}
.ops-banner{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:0 13px;border:1px solid rgba(32,213,232,.28);border-radius:var(--radius);background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(16,45,67,.96),rgba(13,27,45,.94));box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.ops-banner::before{content:"";width:5px;height:20px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(32,213,232,.45)}
.ops-banner b{font-size:13px}.ops-banner small{color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}.ops-badges{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ops-badge{padding:4px 7px;border:1px solid rgba(32,213,232,.3);border-radius:11px;color:#a8edf3;background:rgba(32,213,232,.055);font-size:9px}
.operations-deck .panel{height:100%}.operations-deck .joint-panel{grid-column:1;grid-row:2/4}.operations-deck .motor-panel{grid-column:2;grid-row:2}.operations-deck .sensor-panel{grid-column:3;grid-row:2}.operations-deck .log-panel{grid-column:2/4;grid-row:3}
.operations-deck .joint-panel .status-scroll,.operations-deck .motor-panel .status-scroll,.operations-deck .sensor-panel .status-scroll{height:calc(100% - 34px);max-height:none}
.operations-deck .joint-table .table-head,.operations-deck .joint-row{grid-template-columns:104px 76px 76px 58px 1fr}
.operations-deck .joint-row{height:67px;padding:0 2px;font-size:11px}.operations-deck .joint-value{font-size:14px}.operations-deck .joint-name{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-size:10px}
.operations-deck .joint-panel .pill{min-height:26px;align-items:center;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:14px;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.3px}
.operations-deck .motor-table .table-head,.operations-deck .motor-row{grid-template-columns:58px 1fr 1fr 60px}.operations-deck .motor-row{height:32px;font-size:10px}.operations-deck .meter{height:7px}.operations-deck .meter-label{font-size:9px}
.operations-deck .sensor-card{height:calc(100% - 34px);max-height:none;padding:9px;gap:7px}.operations-deck .sensor-box{padding:7px 8px;font-size:10px}.operations-deck .sensor-box b{font-size:15px}
.operations-deck .logs{height:calc(100% - 34px);padding:7px 10px}.operations-deck .log{grid-template-columns:68px 1fr;padding:4px 0;font-size:10px}

/* ===== Right panel ===== */
.step-card{padding:11px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.step-icon{width:52px;height:52px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan);font-weight:900;font-size:21px;background:rgba(32,213,232,.08)}
.step-card h3{margin:0;font-size:18px;color:var(--cyan)}.step-card p{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}
.step-card .step-percent{margin-left:auto;text-align:right;color:var(--cyan);font-size:24px;font-weight:900}
.step-card .step-percent small{display:block;color:var(--dim);font-size:10px;font-weight:600}
.joint-table,.motor-table{padding:5px 8px}
.status-scroll{overflow:auto;scrollbar-color:#285075 #07121e;scrollbar-width:thin}
.joint-panel .status-scroll{max-height:224px}.motor-panel .status-scroll{max-height:154px}.sensor-panel .status-scroll{max-height:226px}
.table-head,.joint-row,.motor-row{display:grid;align-items:center;gap:4px}
.table-head{height:19px;color:var(--dim);font-size:9px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.55)}
.joint-table .table-head,.joint-row{grid-template-columns:78px 57px 57px 49px 1fr}
.motor-table .table-head,.motor-row{grid-template-columns:54px 1fr 1fr 52px}
.joint-row{height:33px;font-size:10px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.3)}
.joint-row b,.motor-row b{color:var(--cyan)}.joint-name{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted)}
.joint-value{color:#effaff;font-size:11px;font-weight:900}.joint-diff.ok{color:var(--green)}.joint-diff.warn{color:var(--yellow)}.joint-diff.err{color:var(--red)}
.pill{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:8px}
.pill.ok{color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(74,222,128,.45)}.pill.warn{color:var(--yellow);border-color:rgba(247,201,72,.5)}
.pill.err{color:var(--red);border-color:rgba(255,91,91,.5)}
.motor-row{height:23px;font-size:9px}.meter{height:5px;background:#07121e;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:2px}
.meter i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--cyan);border-radius:4px}.meter i.temp{background:var(--yellow)}
.meter-label{color:var(--muted);font-size:8px}
.sensor-card{padding:8px 9px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px}
.sensor-box{padding:6px 7px;border-radius:6px;background:#091522;border:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.58);font-size:9px;color:var(--dim)}
.sensor-box b{display:block;color:var(--text);font-size:14px;margin-top:3px;letter-spacing:.1px}
.sensor-box.wide{grid-column:1/3;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.sensor-box.emphasis{border-color:rgba(32,213,232,.48);background:rgba(32,213,232,.055)}
.sensor-box .unit{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-left:2px}
.logs{height:216px;padding:5px 8px;overflow:auto}
.log{display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr;gap:5px;padding:3px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.27);font-size:9px;line-height:1.35}
.log time{color:var(--dim)}.log.info span{color:var(--cyan)}.log.ok span{color:var(--green)}.log.warn span{color:var(--yellow)}.log.err span{color:var(--red)}
.compact-panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.compact-panel .panel-head{height:36px;flex:0 0 36px;font-size:12px}.compact-body{flex:1;padding:9px 11px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.55}
.compact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:5px}
.compact-metric{padding:8px 9px;border:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.64);border-radius:6px;background:#091522;color:var(--dim);font-size:10px}
.compact-metric b{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:var(--text);font-size:17px}.compact-metric strong{color:var(--cyan)}
.compact-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:9px;align-items:center;padding:3px 0}.compact-line b{color:var(--text);font-size:12px}
.alert-list{display:grid;gap:5px}.alert-item{padding:7px 8px;border-left:3px solid var(--green);border-radius:3px;background:#091522;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}
.alert-item.warn{border-color:var(--yellow);color:#f5df93}.alert-item.err{border-color:var(--red);color:#ffb7b7}
.approach-track{height:8px;margin-top:6px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:7px;background:#07121e}.approach-track i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:7px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cyan),var(--green));transition:.25s}
.approach-zones{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:4px;color:var(--dim);font-size:8px}
.home-btn{color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(74,222,128,.46);background:rgba(74,222,128,.06)}
.precheck-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px}.precheck-item{padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:#091522;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.precheck-item b{display:block;margin-bottom:3px;color:var(--text)}

/* ===== Manual mode ===== */
.manual-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px;height:100%}
.manual-controls{padding:10px;overflow:auto}
.manual-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:112px minmax(95px,1fr) 76px;gap:6px;align-items:center;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.45);font-size:11px}
.manual-row input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--cyan)}
.manual-angle-input{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:6px 7px;border:1px solid rgba(32,213,232,.32);border-radius:5px;color:var(--text);background:#07121e;font-size:11px;text-align:right}
.manual-angle-input:focus{outline:1px solid var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan)}
.manual-row.coupled{background:rgba(32,213,232,.045)}
.manual-row small{display:block;margin-top:3px;color:var(--cyan);font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.3px}
.manual-row-actions{grid-column:2 / 4;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:6px}
.manual-row-actions button{min-width:44px;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px}
.manual-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:12px}
.manual-twin{margin-bottom:10px;padding:10px;border:1px solid rgba(32,213,232,.28);border-radius:7px;background:rgba(9,21,34,.78)}
.manual-twin-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--text);font-size:12px;font-weight:900}
.manual-twin-head::before{content:"";width:4px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--cyan)}
.manual-twin .compact-body{padding:0}

/* ===== Modal ===== */
.modal-backdrop{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:50;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(1,7,13,.76);backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
.modal-backdrop.open{display:flex}
.modal{width:min(880px,90vw);max-height:86vh;overflow:auto;border-radius:12px;background:#0b1929;border:1px solid #285075;box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.48)}
.modal-head{height:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 15px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:800}
.modal-head button{margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);background:none;border:0;font-size:18px}
.modal-body{padding:14px}
.camera-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.form-box{padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#091522;border-radius:7px}
.form-box label{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;margin-bottom:7px}
.form-box select{width:100%;padding:7px;color:var(--text);background:#07121e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px}
.modal-actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:7px;margin-top:12px}
.architecture{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 42px 1fr 42px 1fr;align-items:stretch;gap:4px}
.arch-box{padding:11px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:#091522;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;line-height:1.65}
.arch-box b{display:block;color:var(--cyan);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:3px}.arch-arrow{display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--cyan);font-size:22px}
.can-details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px;margin-top:12px}
.can-details div{padding:8px;border-radius:6px;background:#091522;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:10px;color:var(--dim)}
.can-details b{display:block;color:var(--text);font-size:12px;margin-top:4px}
details{margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}
details pre{white-space:pre-wrap;color:var(--dim);font-size:10px}

/* ===== Easy-operation assistant ===== */
.ai-chat-launch{min-height:76px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;color:var(--cyan);background:rgba(13,27,45,.94);border:1px solid rgba(32,213,232,.68);border-radius:9px;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.25;transition:.15s}
.ai-chat-launch:hover{color:#04161b;background:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(32,213,232,.22)}
.ai-chat-launch .view-icon{font-size:18px;line-height:1}
.ai-chat-panel{position:fixed;right:0;top:0;z-index:80;width:min(430px,94vw);height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#081522;border-left:1px solid #285075;box-shadow:-18px 0 44px rgba(0,0,0,.46);transform:translateX(105%);transition:transform .24s ease}
.ai-chat-panel.open{transform:translateX(0)}
.ai-chat-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:13px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#102238}.ai-chat-head b{font-size:14px}.ai-chat-head small{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:var(--dim);font-size:9px}.ai-chat-close{margin-left:auto;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:22px}
.ai-chat-note{padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);color:#b5d4e8;background:rgba(32,213,232,.05);font-size:10px;line-height:1.5}
.ai-chat-quick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;padding:9px 11px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.ai-chat-quick button{padding:6px 7px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;color:var(--muted);background:#091522;font-size:10px}.ai-chat-quick button:hover{color:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan)}
.ai-chat-messages{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:11px}.ai-msg{max-width:90%;margin-bottom:8px;padding:8px 9px;border-radius:8px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11px;line-height:1.55}.ai-msg.user{margin-left:auto;color:#d5fbff;background:#114154}.ai-msg.bot{color:#dceaf3;background:#102238;border:1px solid rgba(28,56,85,.72)}.ai-msg small{display:block;margin-top:5px;color:var(--dim);font-size:9px}
.ai-chat-form{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:#07121e}.ai-chat-form input{min-width:0;flex:1;padding:9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;color:var(--text);background:#0b1929;font-size:11px}.ai-chat-form button{padding:8px 11px;border:1px solid var(--cyan);border-radius:6px;color:#04161b;background:var(--cyan);font-size:11px;font-weight:900}

/* ===== E-stop state ===== */
body.estop-active::after{content:"";position:fixed;inset:2px;pointer-events:none;z-index:100;border:4px solid var(--red);animation:danger 1s infinite}
body.estop-active .estop{animation:dangerBtn .8s infinite}
body.estop-active .action-control{opacity:.36;pointer-events:none}
@keyframes pulse{50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 7px rgba(32,213,232,0)}0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(32,213,232,.38)}}
@keyframes danger{50%{opacity:.28}}@keyframes dangerBtn{50%{filter:brightness(1.5)}}
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:4px;height:4px}::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#285075;border-radius:4px}::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:#07121e}
@media(max-width:1450px){.layout{grid-template-columns:76px minmax(0,1fr) 370px}.right-panel{width:370px}.view-rail{width:76px}.brand{width:260px;min-width:260px}.brand h1{font-size:17px}.status-chip{padding:0 7px}.joint-table .table-head,.joint-row{grid-template-columns:70px 51px 51px 44px 1fr}}
@media(max-width:980px){.main-stage.split-stage{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ===== SAMBO MOTORS inspired lock/start screen ===== -->
<section class="splash-screen" id="splashScreen" aria-label="삼보모터스 로봇팔 자동 분류 시스템 시작 화면">
  <div class="splash-grid"></div>
  <div class="splash-scan"></div>
  <nav class="splash-nav">
    <div class="splash-logo"><img class="splash-logo-img" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="SAMBO MOTORS"></div>
  </nav>
  <div class="splash-hero">
    <div class="splash-motif">
      <div class="sambo-letter">
        <div class="sambo-panel left"></div>
        <div class="sambo-panel mid"></div>
        <div class="sambo-panel right"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="splash-road"></div>
      <div class="robot-showcase"></div>
      <div class="robot-arm-silhouette" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 220 190" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M32 158 L78 116 L115 126 L159 75" stroke="white" stroke-width="18" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity=".86"/>
          <path d="M32 158 L78 116 L115 126 L159 75" stroke="#69d7ff" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity=".78"/>
          <circle cx="32" cy="158" r="22" fill="#0b2d6b" stroke="white" stroke-width="6"/>
          <circle cx="78" cy="116" r="18" fill="#0b2d6b" stroke="white" stroke-width="5"/>
          <circle cx="115" cy="126" r="16" fill="#0b2d6b" stroke="white" stroke-width="5"/>
          <circle cx="159" cy="75" r="15" fill="#0b2d6b" stroke="white" stroke-width="5"/>
          <path d="M170 64 L205 45 M175 80 L212 82" stroke="white" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="splash-copy">
      <div class="splash-kicker">ROBOT ARM CONTROL GATE</div>
      <h2>New Frontier Spirit</h2>
      <h3>친환경 자동차 부품의 중심, 삼보모터스</h3>
      <p>비전 기반 로봇 티칭, CAN 통신, 센서 피드백, AI 품질 판단을 하나의 작업자 화면으로 통합한 로봇팔 대시보드입니다.</p>
      <div class="splash-meta">
        <span>CAN 125 kbps</span><span>Sample Point 62.5%</span><span>STS3215 × 6</span><span>YOLO · Hailo 8L</span><span>MPU Teaching</span>
      </div>
      <div class="access-card">
        <div>
          <div class="access-title">SECURE DASHBOARD ACCESS</div>
          <div class="access-main">Sambo Robot Arm Dashboard</div>
          <div class="access-sub">작업자 모니터링 화면으로 진입합니다. Enter 키 또는 시작 버튼을 누르세요.</div>
        </div>
        <button class="access-btn" onclick="dismissSplash()">운영 화면 열기</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="splash-footer"><span>MPU TEACHING · AI POSITION CORRECTION · CAN CONTROL</span><span class="mono" id="splashClock">--:--:--</span></div>
</section>

<!-- ===== Fixed header ===== -->
<header class="header">
  <div class="brand brand-with-logo">
    <img class="brand-logo-img" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="SAMBO MOTORS">
    <div class="brand-caption">로봇팔 자동 분류 시스템<br>비전 티칭 · CAN 제어 · 센서 피드백</div>
  </div>
  <div class="header-status">
    <div class="status-chip mode-chip" id="modeChip">TEACHING</div>
    <div class="status-chip"><i class="dot warn" id="serverDot"></i><span><b id="serverText">서버 대기</b><small>Dashboard Server</small></span></div>
    <div class="status-chip"><i class="dot ok" id="canDot"></i><span><b id="canText">CAN 정상</b><small>125 kbps · ID 11-bit</small></span></div>
    <div class="status-chip"><i class="dot warn" id="cameraDot"></i><span><b id="cameraText">카메라 대기</b><small>Human · Gripper Cam</small></span></div>
    <div class="status-chip"><i class="dot run" id="aiDot"></i><span><b id="aiText">YOLO 실행 중</b><small>AI 판단</small></span></div>
    <div class="status-chip demo-banner" id="dataBanner"><i class="dot warn"></i><span>DEMO MODE<small>시뮬레이션 데이터</small></span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="header-time mono"><small>현재 시간</small><span id="clock">--:--:--</span></div>
</header>

<!-- ===== Mode navigation and utility buttons ===== -->
<nav class="toolbar">
  <div class="nav-tabs">
    <button class="tab active" data-mode="TEACHING" onclick="setMode('TEACHING')">티칭 모드</button>
    <button class="tab action-control" data-mode="AUTO_RUN" onclick="setMode('AUTO_RUN')">자동 운전</button>
    <button class="tab action-control" data-mode="MANUAL" onclick="setMode('MANUAL')">수동 시험</button>
  </div>
  <div class="toolbar-spacer"></div>
  <button class="tool-btn home-btn action-control" onclick="goHome()">HOME 복귀</button>
  <button class="tool-btn" onclick="openPrecheck()">운전 준비 점검</button>
  <button class="tool-btn" onclick="openModal('cameraModal')">카메라 보기 / 설정</button>
  <button class="tool-btn" onclick="openModal('systemModal')">시스템 연결도</button>
  <button class="tool-btn" onclick="openModal('canModal')">CAN 상세</button>
</nav>

<main class="layout">
  <aside class="view-rail">
    <div class="rail-title">MAIN VIEW</div>
    <button class="view-btn active" id="robotViewBtn" data-focus="ROBOT_3D" onclick="setFocusView('ROBOT_3D')"><span class="view-icon">◈</span><span id="robotViewLabel">로봇 3D<br>현재 자세</span></button>
    <button class="view-btn" id="monitorViewBtn" data-focus="MONITOR" onclick="setFocusView('MONITOR')"><span class="view-icon">⌁</span><span id="monitorViewLabel">MPU<br>팔 추정</span></button>
    <button class="ai-chat-launch" id="aiChatLaunch" onclick="toggleAiChat()"><span class="view-icon">AI</span><span>AI 작업<br>도우미</span></button>
    <div class="rail-spacer"></div>
    <div class="rail-note">버튼을 눌러<br>큰 화면을<br>전환합니다.</div>
  </aside>
  <section class="workspace">
    <!-- ===== Main changing area ===== -->
    <div class="main-stage" id="mainStage">
      <article class="panel media-panel" id="primaryPanel">
        <div class="panel-head" id="primaryTitle">사람 팔 동작 추정 / MPU Pose Estimate
          <span class="head-right"><span class="source-tag demo" id="primarySource">MPU 추정 시뮬레이션</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="media-wrap" id="primaryMedia">
          <video id="humanVideo" autoplay playsinline muted></video>
          <video id="gripperVideo" autoplay playsinline muted></video>
          <canvas id="humanCanvas"></canvas>
          <canvas id="gripperCanvas"></canvas>
          <div class="crosshair" id="gripperCrosshair" style="display:none"><i></i></div>
          <div class="hud hud-left mono" id="primaryHud"></div>
          <div class="hud hud-right mono" id="primaryHudRight"></div>
          <div class="pose-disclaimer" id="poseDisclaimer">사람 팔 값은 MPU/카메라 기반 추정값입니다. 로봇 제어에는 보정된 목표각만 사용됩니다.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pose-info" id="poseInfo"></div>
      </article>

      <article class="panel media-panel" id="robot3dPanel">
        <div class="panel-head">로봇 3D 분류 셀 / Sorting Twin
          <span class="head-right sim3d-tools">
            <button onclick="rotateView(-.18)">↶ 회전</button><button onclick="rotateView(.18)">회전 ↷</button><button onclick="reset3DView()">기본 시점</button>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="media-wrap">
          <canvas id="robot3dCanvas"></canvas>
          <div class="hud hud-right mono" id="eeHud"></div>
          <div class="sim-labels" id="simLabels"></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== Overview area ===== -->
    <div class="lower-stage">
      <article class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head">평면 이동 보기 / Top-Down View <small>현재 위치 · 목표 위치 · 위험 영역</small></div>
        <div class="topdown-wrap"><canvas id="topdownCanvas"></canvas></div>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head" id="pathTitle">저장 위치(WP) 및 이동 경로</div>
        <div class="path-content">
          <div class="path-track" id="pathTrack"></div>
          <div class="progress"><i id="progressBar"></i></div>
          <div class="route-stats" id="routeStats"></div>
          <div class="wp-actions action-control" id="wpActions">
            <button class="small-btn" onclick="saveWaypoint('WP')">WP 저장</button>
            <button class="small-btn" onclick="saveWaypoint('SCAN')">스캔 위치</button>
            <button class="small-btn" onclick="saveWaypoint('PRE_GRASP')">집기 전 위치</button>
            <button class="small-btn" onclick="saveWaypoint('GRASP')">집는 위치</button>
            <button class="small-btn" onclick="saveWaypoint('PLACE')">놓는 위치</button>
            <button class="small-btn" onclick="exportCSV()">경로 저장</button>
            <button class="small-btn" onclick="clearWaypoints()">처음부터 다시</button>
          </div>
          <div class="wp-list" id="wpList"></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Always-visible status panel ===== -->
  <aside class="right-panel">
    <article class="panel step-card">
      <div class="step-icon" id="stepIcon">03</div>
      <div><p>현재 동작 단계 / Current Step</p><h3 id="stepText">티칭 중</h3><p id="stepDesc">사람 동작을 로봇 목표각으로 변환합니다.</p></div>
      <div class="step-percent mono"><span id="stepPercent">42</span>%<small>경로 진행률</small></div>
    </article>

    <article class="panel compact-panel" id="alertPanel">
      <div class="panel-head">현재 알림 / Alerts <span class="head-right"><span class="source-tag demo" id="alertSource">DEMO</span></span></div>
      <div class="compact-body alert-list" id="alertsCard"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="panel compact-panel" id="precheckPanel">
      <div class="panel-head">운전 준비 상태 / Pre-run Check</div>
      <div class="compact-body" id="precheckSummary"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="panel compact-panel" id="teachingQualityPanel">
      <div class="panel-head">티칭 품질 / Teaching Quality</div>
      <div class="compact-body" id="teachingQualityCard"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="panel compact-panel" id="gripperApproachPanel">
      <div class="panel-head">그리퍼 접근 판단 / Approach Guide</div>
      <div class="compact-body" id="gripperApproachCard"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="panel compact-panel" id="canHealthPanel">
      <div class="panel-head">CAN 통신 건강도 / CAN Health</div>
      <div class="compact-body" id="canHealthCard"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="panel compact-panel" id="calibrationPanel">
      <div class="panel-head">보정 상태 / Calibration</div>
      <div class="compact-body" id="calibrationCard"></div>
    </article>

  </aside>

  <!-- ===== Wide detailed monitoring area ===== -->
  <section class="operations-deck" id="operationsDeck">
    <div class="ops-banner">
      <div><b>운영 상세 모니터링 / Operations Deck</b><br><small>6축 피드백, 모터 부하, 그리퍼 센서와 작업 로그를 넓은 화면에서 확인합니다.</small></div>
      <div class="ops-badges"><span class="ops-badge">STS3215 × 6</span><span class="ops-badge">SG90 · ToF</span><span class="ops-badge">YOLO RESULT</span><span class="ops-badge">EVENT HISTORY</span></div>
    </div>

    <article class="panel joint-panel">
      <div class="panel-head">로봇 관절 상태 / Joint Status <small>STS3215 × 6</small></div>
      <div class="joint-table status-scroll">
        <div class="table-head"><span>관절</span><span>현재각</span><span>목표각</span><span>차이</span><span>상태</span></div>
        <div id="jointRows"></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="panel motor-panel">
      <div class="panel-head">모터 상태 / Motor Status <small>온도 · 부하 · 통신</small></div>
      <div class="motor-table status-scroll">
        <div class="table-head"><span>모터</span><span>온도</span><span>부하</span><span>통신</span></div>
        <div id="motorRows"></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="panel sensor-panel">
      <div class="panel-head">그리퍼 및 AI 판단 / Gripper & AI <span class="head-right"><span class="source-tag demo" id="visionSource">DEMO</span></span></div>
      <div class="sensor-card status-scroll" id="sensorCard"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="panel log-panel">
      <div class="panel-head">이벤트 로그 / Event Log <span class="head-right"><button class="sim3d-tools tool-btn" onclick="exportLogCSV()" style="padding:3px 6px">로그 CSV</button><button class="sim3d-tools tool-btn" onclick="generateRunReport()" style="padding:3px 6px">리포트</button><button class="sim3d-tools tool-btn" onclick="clearLogs()" style="padding:3px 6px">지우기</button></span></div>
      <div class="logs mono" id="eventLogs"></div>
    </article>
  </section>
</main>

<!-- ===== Camera modal ===== -->
<div class="modal-backdrop" id="cameraModal">
  <section class="modal">
    <div class="modal-head">카메라 보기 / 설정 <button onclick="closeModal('cameraModal')">×</button></div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:0">티칭용 사람 팔 카메라와 그리퍼 근처 카메라를 선택합니다. 권한 허용 후 실제 영상 위에 추정선과 YOLO 결과가 표시됩니다.</p>
      <div class="camera-grid">
        <div class="form-box"><label>사람 팔 / MPU 티칭 보조 카메라</label><select id="humanCameraSelect"><option value="">카메라 검색 전</option></select></div>
        <div class="form-box"><label>그리퍼 근처 / AI 인식 카메라</label><select id="gripperCameraSelect"><option value="">카메라 검색 전</option></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-actions">
        <button class="small-btn" onclick="scanCameras()">카메라 다시 검색</button>
        <button class="small-btn" onclick="connectSelectedCameras()">선택 카메라 연결</button>
        <button class="small-btn" onclick="stopCameras()">카메라 연결 해제</button>
        <button class="small-btn" onclick="closeModal('cameraModal')">닫기</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- ===== System architecture modal ===== -->
<div class="modal-backdrop" id="systemModal">
  <section class="modal">
    <div class="modal-head">실제 시스템 연결도 / Hardware Flow <button onclick="closeModal('systemModal')">×</button></div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <div class="architecture">
        <div class="arch-box"><b>상위 제어 / AI</b>Raspberry Pi 5 + Hailo 8L<br>카메라 입력 · YOLO 판단<br>위치 보정 · 경로 관리</div>
        <div class="arch-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="arch-box"><b>CAN 통신</b>CANable Pro · CANH/CANL<br>125 kbps · Sample Point 62.5%<br>Standard 11-bit ID</div>
        <div class="arch-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="arch-box"><b>실시간 제어</b>Arduino Nano + MCP2515<br>URT 보드 UART 통신<br>STS3215 × 6 · SG90 · ToF</div>
      </div>
      <div class="can-details">
        <div>명령 ID<b class="mono">0x100</b></div><div>상태 / ACK<b class="mono">0x200</b></div><div>센서 보고<b class="mono">0x300</b></div><div>서보 전원<b class="mono">7.4~7.5 V</b></div>
      </div>
      <p class="yellow" style="font-size:11px;margin:12px 0 0">E-STOP은 화면 버튼만으로 끝나지 않습니다. 실제 장비에서는 NC 접점 또는 릴레이/컨택터로 STS3215 서보 전원 라인을 물리 차단해야 합니다.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- ===== CAN details modal ===== -->
<div class="modal-backdrop" id="canModal">
  <section class="modal">
    <div class="modal-head">CAN 및 데이터 상세 / Diagnostics <button onclick="closeModal('canModal')">×</button></div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <div class="can-details" style="margin-top:0">
        <div>서버 주소<b class="mono" id="wsUrlLabel">ws://localhost:8765</b></div><div>CAN 속도<b class="mono">125 kbps</b></div><div>Sample Point<b class="mono">62.5%</b></div><div>프레임 ID<b class="mono">Standard 11-bit</b></div>
      </div>
      <details open><summary>상세 로그 / Debug Log</summary><pre id="debugLog">[DEMO] WebSocket 연결을 기다리는 중입니다.
[INFO] 실제 데이터 수신 시 DEMO MODE가 자동 해제됩니다.
[INFO] 0x100: 모터 명령 / 0x200: ACK·상태 / 0x300: 센서 데이터</pre></details>
      <details><summary>WebSocket JSON 입력 예시</summary><pre>{
  "mode": "AUTO_RUN",
  "system": {"can_status":"OK","camera_status":"OK","ai_status":"RUNNING"},
  "robot": {"joints":[{"id":"J1","current":92.3,"target":95.0,"temp":41.2,"load":35}]},
  "vision": {"target":"BOLT","confidence":0.94,"correction":{"dx_mm":2.1,"dy_mm":-1.8}}
}</pre></details>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- ===== Pre-run checklist modal ===== -->
<div class="modal-backdrop" id="precheckModal">
  <section class="modal">
    <div class="modal-head">자동 운전 전 준비 점검 / Pre-run Checklist <button onclick="closeModal('precheckModal')">×</button></div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:0">자동 운전을 시작하기 전에 연결, 센서, HOME 자세와 하드웨어 비상정지 위치를 확인합니다.</p>
      <div class="precheck-list" id="precheckItems"></div>
      <p class="yellow" style="font-size:11px">주의: 실제 비상정지는 하드웨어 E-STOP으로 서보 전원을 차단해야 합니다.</p>
      <div class="modal-actions">
        <button class="small-btn" onclick="renderPrecheck()">다시 점검</button>
        <button class="small-btn" id="precheckAutoBtn" onclick="startAutoFromPrecheck()">점검 후 자동 운전</button>
        <button class="small-btn" onclick="closeModal('precheckModal')">닫기</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- ===== Operator assistant ===== -->
<aside class="ai-chat-panel" id="aiChatPanel" aria-label="AI 작업 도우미">
  <div class="ai-chat-head"><div><b>AI 작업 도우미</b><small>상태 설명 전용 · 로봇 명령 실행 안 함</small></div><button class="ai-chat-close" onclick="toggleAiChat(false)">×</button></div>
  <div class="ai-chat-note">현재 대시보드 값을 쉬운 말로 설명합니다. 실제 제어 명령은 보내지 않습니다. 서버 미연결 시 화면의 DEMO 데이터를 기준으로 답합니다.</div>
  <div class="ai-chat-quick">
    <button onclick="askQuick('지금 가장 먼저 확인할 것은 뭐야?')">우선 확인</button>
    <button onclick="askQuick('J3 모터 상태를 설명해줘')">J3 상태</button>
    <button onclick="askQuick('그리퍼가 지금 집을 수 있어?')">집기 가능?</button>
    <button onclick="askQuick('CAN 통신 상태가 괜찮아?')">CAN 상태</button>
    <button onclick="askQuick('발표용으로 현재 시스템을 한 문단으로 설명해줘')">발표 요약</button>
  </div>
  <div class="ai-chat-messages" id="aiChatMessages">
